## Data Attribution & Acknowledgements

1. **Copernicus Sentinel Data:**
   Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2023) processed by the European Space Agency (ESA) and accessed via the Alaska Satellite Facility (ASF) Distributed Active Archive Center (DAAC) HyP3 on-demand processing service.

2. **Copernicus Digital Elevation Model (GLO-30):**
   Copernicus DEM GLO-30 dataset © DLR e.V. 2010–2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014–2018 provided under the Copernicus Programme by the European Union and ESA.

3. **OpenStreetMap Data:**
   HyP3 water masks utilize OpenStreetMap data © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL).

4. **Institutional Support:**
   Research carried out within the Indian Institute of Remote Sensing (IIRS) / ISRO remote sensing framework.
